meta {
  name: Subscribe User
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/subscriptions/subscribe/{{created_user_id}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-User-ID: {{user_id}}
}

docs {
  Subscribe a user's email to SNS notification topic.
  
  **Admin Only**: This endpoint requires admin privileges.
  
  Flow:
  1. Looks up user by ID and gets their email
  2. Checks if email already subscribed to SNS topic
  3. If already subscribed, returns success (idempotent)
  4. If not subscribed, subscribes email to SNS topic
  5. AWS SNS sends confirmation email to the user
  6. User must click confirmation link to activate subscription
  
  Response: Success message
  
  Errors:
  - 400: Invalid user ID or user has no email
  - 404: User not found
  - 403: Not admin
  
  Note: User will receive a confirmation email from AWS SNS.
  They must click the link to complete subscription.
}
